description:
This is a combined synopsis/solicitation for commercial items prepared in accordance with the format in FAR Part 12.&nbsp; This announcement constitutes the only solicitation.&nbsp; Quotations are being requested and a separate written solicitation will not be issued.&nbsp; 

Solicitation number 12444127Q0002 is issued as a Request for Quotation (RFQ) for Francis Marion Ranger District Office janitorial service. Intent of this Blanket Purchase Agreement (BPA) for Janitorial Services to be performed for the USDA Forest Service, Sumter National Forest, Francis Marion Ranger District. The Period of Performance on the BPA will consist of 12-month base period and four 12-month ordering periods. The BPA does not obligate funds; the Government is obligated only to the extent of authorized purchases actually made under the BPA. There will be five (5) individual (annual) ordering periods which will obligate funds on BPA Call orders. Either party (Government or Awardee) may terminate this agreement at any time. A 30-day notice must be provided in writing to terminate this agreement. 

This acquisition&nbsp; is set-aside for small business concerns.&nbsp; The applicable North American Industry Classification Standard Code is 561720&nbsp; The small business size standard is $22M &nbsp;This acquisition is a Total Small Business Set-Aside.&nbsp; All responsible sources may submit a quotation which will be considered by the agency.&nbsp; 

A formal site visit is not scheduled or mandatory.&nbsp; 

Historical Data (for informational purposes only): 

The previous contract 12444122D0002 was awarded to Reliance Contractors Inc with five Task Orders for a total amount $71,400.00.
